            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jawnie ustaw typ zmiennej <code>fruits</code> jako tablicę ciągów znaków.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Banana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mango&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>string</code>, następnie <code>[</code> i na końcu <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
